cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the accompanying paper and this repository."
title: "RamanujanNestedRadicals: a Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of convergence and exact values of Ramanujan-type nested radicals"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked (zero-`sorry`) Lean 4 development of results from "Nested Radicals of
  Ramanujan's Type with Arbitrary Coefficient Sequences": convergence for bounded
  coefficient sequences, exact convergence of the classical family a_k = N + k - 2 to N,
  the closed-form identity chain and exact limit N for every root order n >= 2 (both
  parities), and the constant-coefficient construction converging to a prescribed target
  with an explicit geometric rate.
type: software
authors:
